  "question": {
    "text": "If the given four electronic configurations.\r\n(i) $n=4, l=1$\r\n(ii) $n=4, l=0$\r\n(iii) $n=3, l=2$\r\n(iv) $n=3, l=1$\r\nare arranged in order of increasing energy, then the order will be",
    "image": null
